  "description": {
    "text": "Nine holofoil cards in a premium sheet made for the film Giratina and the Sky Warrior, released in cinemas on 19 July 2008 and in shops on 1 August 2008. All are Pokémon from the film, including Icy Sky's Shaymin in its Sky Forme, Reverse World's Giratina in its Origin Forme, Dialga and Regigigas. The cards have a holofoil border like the Pokémon LV.X of the time, and Kagemaru Himeno's illustrations join up into one picture.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: 11th Movie Commemoration Set (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 1 July 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260701022118/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/11th_Movie_Commemoration_Set_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A small black leaf mark at the bottom right, and a number out of 009",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game 30th Anniversary Archive (The Pokémon Company): each card's expansion mark",
        "url": "https://www.30tharchive.pokemon-card.com/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: 11th Movie Commemoration Set (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 1 July 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260701022118/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/11th_Movie_Commemoration_Set_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
